# Access control for the 26.2 target.
#
# Prism's ccessWidener(...) in the root build script is the only place this
# is declared; it feeds Fabric as-is and converts the same file into a NeoForge
# access transformer.
#
# The two header lines are the entire 1.21.11 -> 26.x difference. A 1.21.11
# target is obfuscated and remapped by fabric-loom-remap, so it needs the
# "named" namespace. A 26.x target ships unobfuscated, where Loom expects
# "official" -- which on 26.x is already the Mojang name, so the NeoForge
# conversion stays correct on both.
#
# Header only for now: the mod registers no content yet. Phase 2 adds entries
# as the compiler asks for them, with a comment naming the exact error for
# each. The first one to arrive will be CreativeModeTab$Output, which 26.1
# made protected and which therefore cannot be implemented at all.
classTweaker	v1	official